Feature: Create Policy

  Background:
    Given The following API keys exist for the Resource Admin:
      | 22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552 |
      | 22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57227 |
    And a Resource Type for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ",
         "name": "FAQ",
         "description": "Frequently Asked Question Project 1",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ]
      }
      """
    And a Resource Type for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57227' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_2",
         "name": "FAQ_2",
         "description": "Frequently Asked Question Project 2",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "tags": [
            "tags1",
            "tags2"
         ]
      }
      """
    And a Scope for API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' with specific attributes exists
      """json
      {
         "scopeKey": "policy_scope_create"
      }
      """

  Scenario: Positive: create Policy with all required fields.
    Given Resource Admin wants to create a new Policy with the following attributes
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY_1",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
         "resourceType": "FAQ",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "ADMIN"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin creates a new Policy
    Then the Policy is created successfully with response code 201
    And return the created Policy
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY_1",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
         "resourceType": "FAQ",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "ADMIN"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """

