  Scenario: Positive: create Policy with an existing/duplicate key but with different project
    Given an existing Policy from the project A with API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57552' as the following attributes
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY_7",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
