         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "ADMIN-7"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin from the project B with API key '22ee17bd-699e-4b6b-a30b-e854e6c57227' wants to Create a new Policy with the same Key
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY_7",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
         "resourceType": "FAQ_2",
         "scope": "",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete"
         ],
         "roles": [
            "ADMIN-7"
         ],
         "effect": "ALLOW"
      }
      """
    Then the Policy is created successfully with response code 201
    And return the created Policy
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ_ADMIN_POLICY_7",
         "description": "FAQ resource policy for Admin",
